{{/*
  Link to Alertmanager's New Silence form, prefilled with this group's
  common labels (alerts are grouped by `service`, so the silence is
  scoped to exactly the offending service). Base URL is baked at render
  from (for-service :alertmanager public_url) — the caddy /alertmanager
  route — rather than .ExternalURL, so it's consistent with the rest of
  this file's ELP and independent of AM's --web.external-url.

  filter syntax is `{a="b", c="d"}`: open %7B, %2C%20-join the matchers
  (separator only *between* items via the $i guard — a trailing comma
  leaves an empty matcher that AM's parser rejects, blanking the form),
  close %7D. " is %22, = is %3D, , is %2C, space is %20.
*/ -}}
{{ define "__alert_silence_link" -}}
<%= (for-service :alertmanager public_url) %>/#/silences/new?filter=%7B
{{- range $i, $p := .CommonLabels.SortedPairs -}}
{{- if $i }}%2C%20{{ end -}}
{{- $p.Name }}%3D%22{{ $p.Value }}%22
{{- end -}}
%7D
{{- end }}

{{ define "discord.title" -}}
[{{ .Status | toUpper }}{{ if eq .Status "firing" }}:{{ .Alerts.Firing | len }}{{ end }}] {{ if .CommonLabels.service }}{{ .CommonLabels.service }}{{ else }}untagged{{ end }}
{{- end }}

{{/*
  Each bullet renders the alertname as a Discord markdown link to a
  Prometheus *graph* of the triggering query over the last 3 days,
  plus a `logs` link to the Service dashboard scoped to this alert's
  service label.

  Prometheus bakes `<external_url>/graph?g0.expr=<query>&g0.tab=1`
  into .GeneratorURL — tab=1 is the table view. We rewrite to tab=0
  (graph) and append range_input=3d. No need to plumb the expression
  in by hand; .GeneratorURL already has it URL-encoded.

  The dashboard's middle panel filters by `_SYSTEMD_UNIT=$service.service`,
  but the third panel shows all priority-≤3 entries on the host
  regardless of unit — that's where service-less alerts (everything
  bucketed under service=alloy: kernel, scope/slice units) land. So
  the same link works for tagged services and the alloy catch-all.
*/ -}}
{{ define "discord.body" -}}
{{ range .Alerts -}}
* [**{{ .Labels.alertname }}**]({{ reReplaceAll "g0\\.tab=1" "g0.tab=0" .GeneratorURL }}&g0.range_input=3d){{ if .Labels.severity }} _({{ .Labels.severity }})_{{ end }}{{ with .Annotations.summary }} — {{ . }}{{ end }} • [logs](https://<%= hostname %>/grafana/d/service?var-service={{ .Labels.service | urlquery }}&from=now-1h&to=now)
{{ end }}
🔇 [mute this group]({{ template "__alert_silence_link" . }})
{{- end }}
